ient device, at most 4 sends per user and 6 per node in flight, 2 s statement timeout (node-local, `429` before the body is read); a delivery fault answers `/sync` with an empty `to_device` instead of an error. Rooms stay unencrypted (ADR-011). Operators: run migration 000059 with the release; rolling back discards every queued, not yet acknowledged message.
